4. Human-in-the-Loop (HITL) Integration 
A key part of agent UI is allowing the user to approve or edit the JSON data before it's processed further. 
Breakpoints: Configure your agent to interrupt execution after generating a JSON proposal.
Review UI: Render the JSON in a user-friendly format (e.g., a table or form).
Feedback Loop: Upon user submission, send the updated JSON or an "approval" signal back to the agent to continue the workflow. 
